WEBVTT

00:07:58.716 --> 00:08:00.696
Could there be order

00:08:00.696 --> 00:08:03.700
in the chaos that I created?

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.440
Let's take a closer look.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:09.451
Do you recall when I showed you these puzzle pieces?

00:08:09.451 --> 00:08:15.208
What image did it ultimately become? A cobalt horse.

00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:16.985
The plot thickens.

00:08:16.985 --> 00:08:19.190
And then we played a game of tangrams

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:24.180
with an emerald rooster.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:26.378
That one's my favorite.

00:08:26.378 --> 00:08:32.633
And then we had an experiment with a silver ox.